|_|_|i|t|a|≠|‡|ü |c|o|l|l|i|y|a|t|u, |_|_|e|©|u|v|a|k|a|i|t|t|i|ı|a|i|y|i|≠|u|m |n|i|l|a|m |p|e|ü|u|v|a|≠|a |n|‡|≠|k|u|_|_|e|≠|ü|a|v|‡|ü|‡|y|i|ü|ü|u. |n|a|Ò|u|v|a|ı|a|t|u |p|‡|l|a|i |_|_|e|≠|ü|u |_|_|e|ü|ü|‡|ü |p|e|ü|u|t|u|m |_|_|e|≠|i|≠,|v|a|r|u|k|i|≠|ü|a |c|Â|t|t|i|r|a|Ô|k|a|Î|u|Î,
